      "title": "Add pi to the Angle",
      "mathExpression": "\\frac{\\pi}{4} + \\pi = \\frac{5\\pi}{4} \\implies (3, 5\\pi/4)",
      "explanation": "Point in third quadrant.",
      "why": "Positive r equivalent form."
